  96:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****     (+) To read the RTC Backup Data registers, use the HAL_RTCEx_BKUPRead()
  97:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****         function.
  98:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc_ex.c **** 
