1444:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @note   To deactivate the smooth calibration, the field SmoothCalibPlusPulses
1445:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *         must be equal to SMOOTHCALIB_PLUSPULSES_RESET and the field
1446:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *         SmoothCalibMinusPulsesValue mut be equal to 0.
